<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed sharply higher in active trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 579.89, up 7.29.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 299 to 220.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.18.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 21,737,170, compared with 18,707,825.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EDT/2045 GMT)</p>
</text>
